msgstr "Radiellt utåt"

msgid "Radial Inward"
msgstr "Radiellt inåt"

msgid "Based on Z-Order"
msgstr "Utifrån z-ordning"

msgid "Restack Direction"
msgstr "Riktning för omordning"

msgid "Restack Mode"
msgstr "Läge för omordning"

msgid "Reverse Z-Order"
msgstr "Omvänd z-ordning"

msgid "Shuffle Z-Order"
msgstr "Blanda z-ordningen"

msgid ""
"\\n"
"This extension changes the z-order of objects based on their position\\n"
"on the canvas or their current z-order.\\n"
"The extension restacks all the selected objects. Groups are treated as\\n"
"a single object.\\n"
"If elements of a group are selected together with external objects,\\n"
"the elements of the group are extracted and positioned next to the other\\n"
"objects being restacked (elements on different layers are brought together\\n"
"to the same layer).\\n"
"            "
msgstr ""
"\\n"
"Detta tillägg ändrar objektens z-ordning utifrån deras position på ritytan\\n"
"eller deras aktuella z-ordning.\\n"
"Tillägget ordnar om alla markerade objekt. Grupper behandlas som\\n"
"ett enda objekt.\\n"
"Om element i en grupp väljs tillsammans med externa objekt,\\n"
"extraheras gruppelementen och placeras bredvid de andra\\n"
"objekt som ordnas om (element på olika lager förs samman\\n"
"till samma lager).\\n"
"            "

